      "dimension_name": "Correctness",
      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 3,
      "comment": "The judge misapplied the test. Its judge_context gives \"Deed Book 42\" as an acceptable example of naming what S1 records. The reply's survey says \"supported by Deed Book 42, p. 118 (source S1)\", which identifies it as a deed and shows the source was read. The rule doesn't require it inside a plan item."
    },
    {
      "test_id": "ut_research_plan_bpx",
      "dimension_source": "base",
      "dimension_name": "Completeness",
      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 3,
      "comment": "Same misreading: the test says the deed need not be a numbered plan item. It is surfaced in the survey, and the FAN item ties Patrick to Michael's move (chain migration)."
    },
